achelor's degree. Applied against tuition; no separate application.","valueKind":"percentage_of_tuition","valuePercent":20,"valueMinor":null,"currency":"GBP","publishedBy":"institution","verification":{"state":"verified","verifierName":"University of Example (admissions)","verifiedAt":"2026-09-01T09:00:00.000Z","expiresAt":"2027-01-31T23:59:00.000Z","evidenceSummary":"Published by the university through its offer-publication scope and confirmed against the signed partnership."},"conditions":["First-class bachelor's degree or equivalent","Full-time study","Self-funded applicants only"],"deadline":"2026-11-15T23:59:00.000Z"},{"id":"off-ex-waiver","institutionId":"inst-example","programKeys":["example-msc-computer-science","example-msc-public-health","example-bsc-data-science","example-foundation-engineering"],"kind":"fee_waiver","name":"Application fee waiver — direct applications","description":"The £60 application fee is waived for applications submitted through a direct route.","valueKind":"fixed_amount","valuePercent":null,"valueMinor":6000,"currency":"GBP","publishedBy":"institution","verification":{"state":"verified","verifierName":"University of Example (finance)","verifiedAt":"2026-09-01T09:00:00.000Z","expiresAt":"2027-06-30T23:59:00.000Z","evidenceSummary":"Waiver terms supplied by the university's finance office under the offer-publication scope."},"conditions":["Submitted through Modex direct application"],"deadline":null},{"id":"off-no-early","institutionId":"inst-northern","programKeys":["northern-msc-cyber-security","northern-msc-supply-chain"],"kind":"discount","name":"Early tuition payment discount","description":"Five per cent off tuition when the first year is paid in full before enrolment.","valueKind":"percentage_of_tuition","valuePercent":5,"valueMinor":null,"currency":"GBP","publishedBy":"institution","verification":{"state":"verified","verifierName":"Northern Institute of Technology (finance)","verifiedAt":"2026-08-19T09:00:00.000Z","expiresAt":"2027-03-31T23:59:00.000Z","evidenceSummary":"Terms confirmed in writing by the institute's finance office."},"conditions":["Payment in full before enrolment","Non-refundable after enrolment"],"deadline":null},{"id":"off-no-regional","institutionId":"inst-northern","programKeys":["northern-meng-mechanical-engineering"],"kind":"scholarship","name":"West Africa Engineering Bursary","description":"Bursary for engineering applicants ordinarily resident in West Africa.","valueKind":"fixed_amount","valuePercent":null,"valueMinor":300000,"currency":"GBP","publishedBy":"institution","verification":{"state":"expiring","verifierName":"Northern Institute of Technology (admissions)","verifiedAt":"2026-03-01T09:00:00.000Z","expiresAt":"2026-10-01T23:59:00.000Z","evidenceSummary":"Confirmed at the start of the cycle; re-confirmation requested and not yet returned."},"conditions":["Ordinarily resident in a West African country","Undergraduate engineering programmes only"],"deadline":"2027-05-31T23:59:00.000Z"},{"id":"off-third-party","institutionId":null,"programKeys":[],"kind":"scholarship","name":"Global Futures Study Grant (third-party claim)","description":"A grant advertised by a third-party organisation. Modex has not been able to confirm it with any university or with the awarding body.","valueKind":"fixed_amount","valuePercent":null,"valueMinor":500000,"currency":"GBP","publishedBy":"third_party","verification":{"state":"unverified","verifierName":null,"verifiedAt":null,"expiresAt":null,"evidenceSummary":null},"conditions":[],"deadline":null,"unverifiedNotice":"Shown because a student asked about it, not because it is confirmed. No money should be sent to anyone in connection with this grant."}],"questions":[{"id":"qa-1","topic":"accommodation","institutionId":"inst-example","question":"Is university accommodation guaranteed for international postgraduates?","answer":"It was not automatic for me. I applied through the accommodation portal the week after I accepted my offer and got a room in the postgraduate hall; two people I know applied in August and ended up in a private flat. Apply as soon as you accept, and check the deposit deadline separately from the tuition deposit.","guideId":"guide-amara","answeredAt":"2026-08-14T10:15:00.000Z","moderationState":"approved","helpfulCount":41},{"id":"qa-2","topic":"cost_of_living","institutionId":"inst-example","question":"Roughly what does a month cost in Example City outside tuition?","answer":"My own numbers for last term: room in a shared postgraduate flat, food, transport and phone came to about £900 a month, and that was without eating out much. The university's own cost-of-living page quotes a similar range. Treat any figure you see, including mine, as one person's experience.","guideId":"guide-amara","answeredAt":"2026-08-20T18:02:00.000Z","moderationState":"approved","helpfulCount":63},{"id":"qa-3","topic":"part_time_work","institutionId":"inst-example","question":"Can I work while studying, and did you find it easy?","answer":"Work rights come from your visa, not from the university, so check the conditions on your own visa — I cannot advise on that. What I can say is that campus jobs are posted on the student jobs board every September and the library and the sports centre hire the most students.","guideId":"guide-bilal","answeredAt":"2026-07-30T09:40:00.000Z","moderationState":"approved","helpfulCount":29},{"id":"qa-4","topic":"teaching_style","institutionId":"inst-example","question":"How is the public health master's actually assessed?","answer":"Two of my five modules were exam-based, the rest were coursework, and the practice project is assessed on a report plus a presentation to a panel. The module handbooks are published before you enrol, and they are the honest answer to this question.","guideId":"guide-chen","answeredAt":"2026-09-02T12:00:00.000Z","moderationState":"approved","helpfulCount":17},{"id":"qa-5","topic":"arrival_and_settling_in","institutionId":"inst-northern","question":"What should I sort out in the first week in Northgate?","answer":"Register with a doctor, get a bank account started (the university letter is the thing that unblocks it), and buy the student bus pass — it pays for itself in about three weeks. The international office runs a drop-in every afternoon of welcome week.","guideId":"guide-priya","answeredAt":"2026-08-28T16:20:00.000Z","moderationState":"approved","helpfulCount":22},{"id":"qa-6","topic":"visa_paperwork_experience","institutionId":"inst-example","question":"Can you tell me whether my visa will be approved?","answer":"No, and nobody on this platform can. What I can describe is my own experience of the paperwork order: the university issues the study confirmation after you accept and pay the deposit, and everything else follows from that. For the decision itself, the official government guidance is the only source that counts.","guideId":"guide-chen","answeredAt":"2026-09-05T08:05:00.000Z","moderationState":"approved","helpfulCount":35}],"demoStudent":{"id":"student-demo","displayName":"Amina Yusuf","email":"student@modex.test","profile":{"id":"profile-demo","userId":"student-demo","dateOfBirth":"2001-04-18","nationality":"NG","countryOfResidence":"NG","intendedLevel":"postgraduate_taught","intendedField":"Computer science","preferredCountries":["GB","NL"],"budgetPerYear":{"amountMinor":2400000,"currency":"GBP"},"targetIntake":"2027-01","academicRecords":[{"level":"bachelors","institutionName":"University of Lagos","countryCode":"NG","fieldOfStudy":"Computer science","grade":{"scale":"gpa_4","value":3.4},"startedAt":"2019-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","completedAt":"2023-07-01T00:00:00.000Z"}],"languageTests":[{"test":"ielts","overall":7,"bands":{"listening":7.5,"reading":7,"writing":6.5,"speaking":7},"takenAt":"2026-02-10T00:00:00.000Z","expiresAt":"2028-02-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"workExperienceMonths":18,"updatedAt":"2026-09-10T12:00:00.000Z"},"documents":[{"id":"doc-transcript","type":"transcript","displ